@page "/components/resizable"

<PageTitle>Resizable — Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn</PageTitle>

<h1 class="doc-h1">Resizable</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">
    The handle rewrites <code>flex-grow</code> on the panel either side of it, so a drag costs one
    style recalculation rather than a render. Arrow keys move it too:
    <code>role="separator"</code> promises that, and a divider only a pointer can move is one half
    the people using it cannot.
</p>

