<h2 class="doc-h2">Handle</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    Without the grip the handle is a one-pixel line: findable by pointer, and nothing says it can
    be dragged. The grip is the affordance, not decoration.
</p>
<Example Source="ResizableHandleExample.razor"><ResizableHandleExample /></Example>

<h2 class="doc-h2">RTL</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    Nothing to change: the drag is measured with <code>getBoundingClientRect</code>, which is
    already direction-aware, and the panels are laid out by flex.
</p>
<Example Source="ResizableRtl.razor"><ResizableRtl /></Example>
